claim.claim-text:
establishing a cellular link that provides access to a fifth generation core (5GC) network;
establishing a protocol data unit (PDU) session with a cellular network entity of the 5GC network;
determining one or more quality of service (QoS) flow descriptions for the PDU session; and
requesting modification of the one or more QoS flow descriptions for the PDU session.

establishing a protocol data unit (PDU) session with a wireless device;
determining one or more quality of service (QoS) flow descriptions for the PDU session with the wireless device; and
modifying one or more QoS flow descriptions for the PDU session with the wireless device.
